---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { href } from '../lib/content';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About"
  description="About NegotiatedTruth, a personal journal by Cătălin Criveteanu about strategy, technology and AI."
>
  <section class="shell page-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">A short introduction</span>
    <h1>I'm Cătălin.</h1>
    <p>
      This is my personal journal about strategy, technology and AI, and the
      decisions that connect them.
    </p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose legal">
    <p>
      I’m interested in the gap between an appealing idea and something that
      works. What do we assume? What do we actually know? And what happens when
      we try?
    </p>
    <p>
      NegotiatedTruth is a place to work through those questions in public. A
      point of view can be useful without being the last word.
    </p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <p>
      Essays that stay with a question. Short notes that capture a thought
      before it gets lost. Occasional visual stories that use diagrams and
      worked examples to make a complicated idea easier to follow.
    </p>
    <h2>A journal in the making</h2>
    <p>
      The writing in this preview is clearly labelled sample content. My
      original articles and a fuller personal introduction will follow.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={siteConfig.github}>Find me on GitHub ↗</a>
      <br />
      <a href={href('rss.xml')}>Follow new writing via RSS ↗</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
